        "original_id": "17113a5b-af1a-59e1-99b1-c27e030e42f6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Finance, I'm the Boss!, Monopoly, The Landlord's Game\n- Concepts: board game mechanics, negotiation games, Chance cards, Community Chest cards\n\nFacts:\n- The board game Finance is based on The Landlord's Game in its movement of pieces around the board, its use of cards, its purchasable properties, and its houses that can be erected on properties.\n- Monopoly and Finance use special cards called Chance cards and Community Chest cards.\n- I'm the Boss! is a negotiation game in which players both compete and cooperate to assemble profitable business deals.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
